2026-04-05 09:12:34.544 | 24908 (24908) | DEBUG    | Processing tool event with attributes: {'gen_ai.tool.name': 'create_file', 'gen_ai.tool.call.id': 'pyd_ai_47b5bc74ece64b249d8b95b04b593ed2', 'tool_arguments': '{"initial_content":"# Product Context - Arkan\\n\\n## Product Vision\\nArkan is the most comprehensive AI-powered writing and document generation platform, designed to empower academics, professionals, and students to create high-quality content efficiently and effectively.\\n\\n## Product Mission\\nTo democratize access to professional-grade writing tools by leveraging cutting-edge AI technology, making advanced content creation capabilities accessible to users regardless of their technical expertise or geographical location.\\n\\n## Target Market & Audience\\n\\n### Primary Segments\\n- **Academic Researchers & Students**: Focus on citation stability, structural logic, and research synthesis.\\n- **Business Professionals**: Focus on report production, executive summaries, and presentation synthesis.\\n- **Educational Institutions**: Focus on lecture generation and assignment solving.\\n\\n### Geographic Markets\\n- **Primary**: Middle East & North Africa (MENA) with native Arabic/RTL support.\\n- **Secondary**: International English-speaking markets.\\n\\n## Core Product Features\\n\\n### AI Writing Tools Suite (23+ Tools)\\n- Flagship tools: Summarizer, Researcher, Stylist, and Document Writer.\\n\\n### Document Generation System\\n- **Report Mode**: Multi-node, template-driven synthesis with high-fidelity DOCX export.\\n- **Presentation Builder**: AI slide generation with PPTX production manifest.\\n- **Spectral Analysis**: Deep decomposition of source data into structural intelligence.\\n\\n### Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG)\\n- **Context-Aware Generation**: Grounded AI responses using the centralized Knowledge Base.\\n- **Analytical Oversight**: Real-time retrieval monitoring, query testing, and system health manifests.\\n\\n## Product Differentiation\\n\\n### Unique Value Propositions\\n1. **Intelligence Suite Aesthetic**: A professional, technical \\"IDE-style\\" interaction model.\\n2. **Production Robustness**: Zero-tolerance for runtime errors via defensive programming and neural error boundaries.\\n3. **Full Observability**: Real-time telemetry pulses for neural retrieval latency and cache efficiency.\\n4. **Cultural Adaptation**: Native support for Arabic and RTL layouts.\\n\\n### Competitive Advantages\\n\\n#### Technology Stack\\n- **Next.js 15 / React 19**: Utilizing the latest concurrent features and server-side optimizations.\\n- **Qdrant Vector Store**: Sub-100ms search latency for high-scale context retrieval.\\n- **Mission Control UI**: Sophisticated real-time analytics using Recharts for pipeline oversight.\\n\\n#### User Experience\\n- **IDE Pattern**: 3-zone workspace optimized for complex document production.\\n- **Manifest Interaction Model**: Technical, multi-step manifests for critical operations.\\n- **Stable Manifests**: Operational feedback via pulsing status nodes and versioned manifest footers.\\n\\n## Business Model\\n- **Primary**: Credit-based acquisition for advanced AI operations.\\n- **Secondary**: Subscription tiers for institutional access.\\n\\n## Success Metrics & KPIs\\n- MAU, retention, credit acquisition volume, and retrieval latency benchmarks.\\n","file_path":"memory-bank/productContext.md","overwrite":true}', 'logfire.msg': 'running tool: create_file', 'logfire.json_schema': '{"type": "object", "properties": {"tool_arguments": {"type": "object"}, "tool_response": {"type": "object"}, "gen_ai.tool.name": {}, "gen_ai.tool.call.id": {}}}', 'logfire.span_type': 'span', 'original_content': '', 'tool_response': 'Successfully updated memory-bank/productContext.md.'}
